abstract: >-
  An event-driven Linux watchdog and diagnostic capture service for a correlated
  NVIDIA GSP runtime-power and Intel Alder Lake PCH xHCI failure sequence
  investigated on the Gigabyte AORUS 5 SE4 laptop.
